add keeps the caller's state: peers 0/0, queued 0; new state peers 1, queued 1
enqueue keeps the caller's queue: 0/0, new 1
suspicion keeps the caller's peer: before alive/1, after suspect/1
a join about myself is not a peer: b absent, c alive/1, peers 1
precedence: suspect@1 suspect/1, alive@1 suspect/1, dead@1 dead/1, alive@1 dead/1, alive@2 alive/2
